  <p class="how"><b>How to read this page.</b> Every claim wears a tag. <span class="tag text" tabindex="0" data-tip="A source says it. Cited in the ledger at the end.">text</span> means a source says it, cited in the ledger. <span class="tag read" tabindex="0" data-tip="The inference laid on top of the text.">reading</span> marks the inference laid on top of the text. <span class="tag disp" tabindex="0" data-tip="The author’s own argument, forward-looking.">disputed</span> marks the one argument that is the author’s own and looks forward. Each movement has one thing to touch.</p>
